        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin FAI-RSR, Covered Deadbolt Fairbanks Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fairbanks Handleset is available in either dark bronze or white bronze finishes, both of which have a 25 year warranty. Made by Baldwin as part of the Reserve collection, this Covered Deadbolt Fairbanks Entryset had a classic look perfect for traditionally styled homes. It has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. A grade 2 lock, it will fit standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors with 1-3/4 inch - 2-1/2 inch thicknesses. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection Fairbanks Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection Fairbanks Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 17-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fairbanks Handleset with Rustic Square Rose, Baldwin FAI-RSR",
                "description": "Baldwin FAI-RSR, Fairbanks Handleset with Rustic Square Rose - The Fairbanks Handleset is available in either dark bronze or white bronze finishes, both of which have a 25 year warranty. Made by Baldwin as part of the Reserve collection, this Covered Deadbolt Fairbanks Entryset had a classic look perfect for traditionally styled homes. It has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. A grade 2 lock, it will fit standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors with 1-3/4 inch - 2-1/2 inch thicknesses. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions.",
